d:idSpecObject_719626865_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.20(c).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) If the aeroplane is equipped with an engine control system that automatically resets the power or thrust on the operating engine(s) when any engine fails during take-off, additional requirements pertaining to aeroplane performance and limitations and the functioning and reliability of the system, contained in Appendix I, must be complied with.</div>" ;
