d:idSpecObject_-862454206_9
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.21(e).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) If compliance with the flight characteristics requirements is dependent upon a stability augmentation system or upon any other automatic or power-operated system, compliance must be shown with CS 25.671 and 25.672.</div>" ;
