d:idSpecObject_55650433_19
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.109(c).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) The wet runway braking coefficient of friction for a smooth wet runway is defined as a curve of friction coefficient versus ground speed and must be computed as follows:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "109" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Accelerate-stop distance" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "PERFORMANCE" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10149" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_55650433_20
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.109(c)(1).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) The maximum tyre-to-ground wet runway braking coefficient of friction is defined as (see Figure 1): Figure 1 where: Tyre Pressure = maximum aeroplane operating tyre pressure (psi) µt/gMAX = maximum tyre-to-ground braking coefficient V = aeroplane true ground speed (knots); and Linear interpolation may be used for tyre pressures other than those listed.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "109" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Accelerate-stop distance" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "PERFORMANCE" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10149" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_55650433_28
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.109(c)(2).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) (See AMC 25.109(c)(2) The maximum tyre-to-ground wet runway braking coefficient of friction must be adjusted to take into account the efficiency of the anti-skid system on a wet runway. Anti-skid system operation must be demonstrated by flight testing on a smooth wet runway and its efficiency must be determined. Unless a specific anti-skid system efficiency is determined from a quantitative analysis of the flight testing on a smooth wet runway, the maximum tyre-to-ground wet runway braking coefficient of friction determined in sub-paragraph (c)(1) of this paragraph must be multiplied by the efficiency value associated with the type of anti-skid system installed on the aeroplane: </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "109" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Accelerate-stop distance" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "PERFORMANCE" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10149" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_55650433_30
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.109(d).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) At the option of the applicant, a higher wet runway braking coefficient of friction may be used for runway surfaces that have been grooved or treated with a porous friction course material. For grooved and porous friction course runways,</div>" ;
