	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.121(b).Amendment 16;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) Take-off; landing gear retracted. In the take-off configuration existing at the point of the flight path at which the landing gear is fully retracted, and in the configuration used in CS 25.111 but without ground effect, </div>" ;
