	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.123(b)(2)(i).Amendment 16;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) A speed of 1.18VSR with the most critical of the “En-route Ice ” accretion(s) exceeds the en-route speed selected in non-icing conditions by more than the greater of 5.6 km/h (3 knots) CAS or 3% of VSR, or</div>" ;
