	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) For three- or four-engined aeroplanes, the two-engine-inoperative net flight path data must represent the actual climb performance diminished by a gradient climb of 0·3% for three-engined aeroplanes and 0·5% for four-engined aeroplanes.</div>" ;
