d:idSpecObject_1370083084_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.143(b).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) (See AMC 25.143(a) and (b)) It must be possible to make a smooth transition from one flight condition to any other flight condition without exceptional piloting skill, alertness, or strength, and without danger of exceeding the aeroplane limit-load factor under any probable operating conditions, including:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
