	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) (See AMC 25.145(a).) It must be possible at any point between the trim speed prescribed in CS 25.103(b)(6) and stall identification (as defined in CS 25.201(d)), to pitch the nose downward so that the acceleration to this selected trim speed is prompt with:</div>" ;
