	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(4) With power off, wing-flaps retracted and the aeroplane trimmed at 1·3 VSR1, rapidly set go-around power or thrust while maintaining the same airspeed.</div>" ;
