	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.145(b)(6).Amendment 21;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(6) With power off, wing-flaps extended and the aeroplane trimmed at 1·3 VSR1 obtain and maintain airspeeds between VSW and either 1·6 VSR1, or VFE, whichever is the lower.</div>" ;
