d:idSpecObject_525302954_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.149(a).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) In establishing the minimum control speeds required by this paragraph, the method used to simulate critical engine failure must represent the most critical mode of powerplant failure with respect to controllability expected in service.</div>" ;
