d:idSpecObject_-1242179030_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.177(a).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) The static directional stability (as shown by the tendency to recover from a skid with the rudder free) must be positive for any landing gear and flap position and symmetrical power condition, at speeds from 1·13 VSR1, up to VFE, VLE, or VFC/MFC (as appropriate).</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "177" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Static directional and lateral stability" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "STABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10141" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-1242179030_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.177(b).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) The static lateral stability (as shown by the tendency to raise the low wing in a sideslip with the aileron controls free) for any landing gear and wingflap position and symmetric power condition, may not be negative at any airspeed (except that speeds higher than VFE need not be considered for wingflaps extended configurations nor speeds higher than VLE for landing gear extended configurations) in the following airspeed ranges:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "177" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Static directional and lateral stability" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "STABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10141" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

