d:idSpecObject_443791706_18
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.201(d)(3).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) The pitch control reaches the aft stop and no further increase in pitch attitude occurs when the control is held full aft for a short time before recovery is initiated. (See AMC 25.201(d)(3).) </div>" ;
