d:idSpecObject_-544745901_24
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.207(i).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) In showing compliance with subparagraph (h) of this paragraph, if stall warning is provided by a different means in icing conditions than for non-icing conditions, compliance with CS 25.203 must be shown using the accretion defined in appendix C, part II(e). Compliance with this requirement must be shown using the demonstration prescribed by CS 25.201, except that the deceleration rates of CS 25.201(c)(2) need not be demonstrated.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
