	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.255(b).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) In the out-of-trim condition specified in sub-paragraph (a) of this paragraph, when the normal acceleration is varied from + 1 g to the positive and negative values specified in sub-paragraph (c) of this paragraph –</div>" ;
