d:idSpecObject_388814335_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.341(a).Amendment 12;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) Discrete Gust Design Criteria. The aeroplane is assumed to be subjected to symmetrical vertical and lateral gusts in level flight. Limit gust loads must be determined in accordance with the following provisions: </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "341" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Gust and turbulence loads" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 12;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "FLIGHT MANOEUVRE AND GUST CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9711" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2012/008/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2012-07-13T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2012-07-13T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_388814335_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.341(a)(1).Amendment 12;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) Loads on each part of the structure must be determined by dynamic analysis. The analysis must take into account unsteady aerodynamic characteristics and all significant structural degrees of freedom including rigid body motions.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "341" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Gust and turbulence loads" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 12;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "FLIGHT MANOEUVRE AND GUST CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9711" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2012/008/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2012-07-13T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2012-07-13T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_388814335_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.341(a)(2).Amendment 12;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) The shape of the gust must be taken as follows: for 0 ≤ s ≤ 2H for s &gt; 2H where – s = distance penetrated into the gust (metre); Uds = the design gust velocity in equivalent airspeed specified in sub-paragraph (a) (4) of this paragraph; H = the gust gradient which is the distance (metre) parallel to the aeroplane’s flight path for the gust to reach its peak velocity. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "341" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Gust and turbulence loads" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 12;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "FLIGHT MANOEUVRE AND GUST CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9711" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2012/008/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2012-07-13T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2012-07-13T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_388814335_13
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.341(a)(3).Amendment 12;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) A sufficient number of gust gradient distances in the range 9 m (30 feet) to 107 m (350 feet) must be investigated to find the critical response for each load quantity.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "341" ;
