d:idSpecObject_-2014239363_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.345(a)(2).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Positive and negative gusts of 7.62 m/sec (25 ft/sec) EAS acting normal to the flight path in level flight. Gust loads resulting on each part of the structure must be determined by rational analysis. The analysis must take into account the unsteady aerodynamic characteristics and rigid body motions of the aircraft. (See AMC 25.345(a).) The shape of the gust must be as described in CS 25.341(a)(2) except that – Uds = 7.62 m/sec (25 ft/sec) EAS; H = 12.5 c; and c = mean geometric chord of the wing (metres (feet)). </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "345" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "High lift devices" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "FLIGHT MANOEUVRE AND GUST CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10114" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-2014239363_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.345(b).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) The aeroplane must be designed for the conditions prescribed in sub-paragraph (a) of this paragraph except that the aeroplane load factor need not exceed 1·0, taking into account, as separate conditions, the effects of –</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
