d:idSpecObject_-761577566_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.361(a)(1)(iii).Amendment 8;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(iii) For turbo-propeller installations only, in addition to the conditions specified in subparagraphs (a)(1)(i) and (ii), a limit engine torque corresponding to take-off power and propeller speed, multiplied by a factor accounting for propeller control system malfunction, including quick feathering, acting simultaneously with 1 g level flight loads. In the absence of a rational analysis, a factor of 1·6 must be used.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "361" ;
