	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-920989927_9
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.365(e).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) Any structure, component or part, inside or outside a pressurised compartment, the failure of which could interfere with continued safe flight and landing, must be designed to withstand the effects of a sudden release of pressure through an opening in any compartment at any operating altitude resulting from each of the following conditions:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "365" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Pressurised compartment loads" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10153" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-920989927_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.365(e)(1).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) The penetration of the compartment by a portion of an engine following an engine disintegration.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "365" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Pressurised compartment loads" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10153" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-920989927_11
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.365(e)(2).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Any opening in any pressurised compartment up to the size Ho in square feet; however, small compartments may be combined with an adjacent pressurised compartment and both considered as a single compartment for openings that cannot reasonably be expected to be confined to the small compartment. The size Ho must be computed by the following formula: <object data=\"images/CS-25_27_-920989927-12.jpg\" type=\"image/jpg\"></object> where, Ho = maximum opening in square feet, need not exceed 20 square feet. P = As = maximum cross sectional area of the pressurised shell normal to the longitudinal axis, in square feet; and </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "365" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Pressurised compartment loads" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10153" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-920989927_17
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.365(e)(3).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) The maximum opening caused by aeroplane or equipment failures not shown to be extremely improbable. (See AMC 25.365(e).)</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "365" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)(3)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Pressurised compartment loads" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10153" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-920989927_18
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.365(f).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(f) In complying with sub-paragraph (e) of this paragraph, the fail-safe features of the design may be considered in determining the probability of failure or penetration and probable size of openings, provided that possible improper operation of closure devices and inadvertent door openings are also considered. Furthermore, the resulting differential pressure loads must be combined in a rational and conservative manner with 1 g level flight loads and any loads arising from emergency depressurisation conditions. These loads may be considered as ultimate conditions; however, any deformation associated with these conditions must not interfere with continued safe flight and landing. The pressure relief provided by the intercompartment venting may also be considered.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "365" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(f)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Pressurised compartment loads" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10153" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-920989927_19
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.365(g).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(g) Bulkheads, floors, and partitions in pressurised compartments for occupants must be designed to withstand conditions specified in sub-paragraph (e) of this paragraph. In addition, reasonable design precautions must be taken to minimise the probability of parts becoming detached and injuring occupants while in their seats.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
