d:idSpecObject_2096660136_3
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.367(a).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) The aeroplane must be designed for the unsymmetrical loads resulting from the failure of the critical engine. Turbo-propeller aeroplanes must be designed for the following conditions in combination with a single malfunction of the propeller drag limiting system, considering the probable pilot corrective action on the flight controls:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "367" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Unsymmetrical loads due to engine failure" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8395" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_2096660136_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.367(a)(1).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) At speeds between VMC and VD, the loads resulting from power failure because of fuel flow interruption are considered to be limit loads.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "367" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Unsymmetrical loads due to engine failure" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8395" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_2096660136_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.367(a)(2).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) At speeds between VMC and VC, the loads resulting from the disconnection of the engine compressor from the turbine or from loss of the turbine blades are considered to be ultimate loads.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "367" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Unsymmetrical loads due to engine failure" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8395" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_2096660136_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.367(a)(3).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) The time history of the thrust decay and drag build-up occurring as a result of the prescribed engine failures must be substantiated by test or other data applicable to the particular engine-propeller combination.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "367" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(3)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Unsymmetrical loads due to engine failure" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8395" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_2096660136_7
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.367(a)(4).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(4) The timing and magnitude of the probable pilot corrective action must be conservatively estimated, considering the characteristics of the particular engine-propeller-aeroplane combination.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "367" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(4)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Unsymmetrical loads due to engine failure" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8395" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_2096660136_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.367(b).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) Pilot corrective action may be assumed to be initiated at the time maximum yawing velocity is reached, but not earlier than two seconds after the engine failure. The magnitude of the corrective action may be based on the control forces specified in CS 25.397(b) except that lower forces may be assumed where it is shown by analysis or test that these forces can control the yaw and roll resulting from the prescribed engine failure conditions. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "367" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Unsymmetrical loads due to engine failure" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SUPPLEMENTARY CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8395" ;
