d:idSpecObject_1357185748_15
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.473(e).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) The coefficient of friction between the tyres and the ground may be established by considering the effects of skidding velocity and tyre pressure. However, this coefficient of friction need not be more than 0·8.</div>" ;
