d:idSpecObject_1575056278_7
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.479(b).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) For the level landing attitude for aeroplanes with tail wheels, the conditions specified in this paragraph must be investigated with the aeroplane horizontal reference line horizontal in accordance with Figure 2 of Appendix A of CS-25.</div>" ;
