	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.479(c).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) For the level landing attitude for aeroplanes with nose wheels, shown in Figure 2 of Appendix A of CS-25, the conditions specified in this paragraph must be investigated assuming the following attitudes:</div>" ;
