	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.509(a).Amendment 13;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) The towing loads specified in sub-paragraph (d) of this paragraph must be considered separately. These loads must be applied at the towing fittings and must act parallel to the ground. In addition –</div>" ;
