d:idSpecObject_-1383213079_13
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.511(c).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) Deflated tyres. The effect of deflated tyres on the structure must be considered with respect to the loading conditions specified in sub-paragraphs (d) through (f) of this paragraph, taking into account the physical arrangement of the gear components. In addition – </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "511" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Ground load: unsymmetrical loads on multiple-wheel units" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "GROUND LOADS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8526" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-1383213079_14
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.511(c)(1).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) The deflation of any one tyre for each multiple wheel landing gear unit, and the deflation of any two critical tyres for each landing gear unit using four or more wheels per unit, must be considered; and</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "511" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Ground load: unsymmetrical loads on multiple-wheel units" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "GROUND LOADS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8526" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-1383213079_15
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.511(c)(2).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) The ground reactions must be applied to the wheels with inflated tyres except that, for multiple-wheel gear units with more than one shock strut, a rational distribution of the ground reactions between the deflated and inflated tyres, accounting for the differences in shock strut extensions resulting from a deflated tyre, may be used.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "511" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Ground load: unsymmetrical loads on multiple-wheel units" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "GROUND LOADS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8526" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-1383213079_16
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.511(d).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) Landing conditions. For one and for two deflated tyres, the applied load to each gear unit is assumed to be 60% and 50%, respectively, of the limit load applied to each gear for each of the prescribed landing conditions. However, for the drift landing condition of CS 25.485, 100% of the vertical load must be applied. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "511" ;
