	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) Tie-down. If tie-down points are provided, the main tie-down points and local structure must withstand the limit loads resulting from a 120 km/h (65-knot) horizontal wind from any direction. </div>" ;
