d:idSpecObject_502859743_7
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.562(b).Amendment 21;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) Each seat type design approved for occupancy must successfully complete dynamic tests or be demonstrated by rational analysis based on dynamic tests of a similar seat type, in accordance with each of the following emergency landing conditions. The tests must be conducted with an occupant simulated by a 77kg (170 lb) anthropomorphic, test dummy sitting in the normal upright position:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "562" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency landing dynamic conditions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 21;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY LANDING CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10257" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2018/005/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2018-03-28T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2018-03-28T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_502859743_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.562(b)(1).Amendment 21;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) A change in downward vertical velocity, (∆v) of not less than 10·7 m/s, (35 ft/s) with the aeroplane’s longitudinal axis canted downward 30 degrees with respect to the horizontal plane and with the wings level. Peak floor deceleration must occur in not more than 0·08 seconds after impact and must reach a minimum of 14 g.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "562" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency landing dynamic conditions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 21;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY LANDING CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10257" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2018/005/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2018-03-28T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2018-03-28T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_502859743_9
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.562(b)(2).Amendment 21;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) A change in forward longitudinal velocity (∆v) of not less than 13·4 m/s, (44 ft/s) with the aeroplane’s longitudinal axis horizontal and yawed 10 degrees either right or left, whichever would cause the greatest likelihood of the upper torso restraint system (where installed) moving off the occupant’s shoulder, and with the wings level. Peak floor deceleration must occur in not more than 0·09 seconds after impact and must reach a minimum of 16 g. With the exception of flight deck crew seats that are mounted in the forward conical area of the fuselage, where floor rails or floor fittings are used to attach the seating devices to the test fixture, the rails or fittings must be misaligned with respect to the adjacent set of rails or fittings by at least 10 degrees vertically (i.e. out of parallel) with one rolled 10 degrees.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "562" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency landing dynamic conditions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 21;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY LANDING CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10257" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2018/005/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2018-03-28T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2018-03-28T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_502859743_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.562(c).Amendment 21;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) The following performance measures must not be exceeded during the dynamic tests conducted in accordance with sub-paragraph (b) of this paragraph:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "562" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency landing dynamic conditions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 21;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY LANDING CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10257" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2018/005/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2018-03-28T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2018-03-28T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_502859743_11
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.562(c)(1).Amendment 21;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) Where upper torso straps are used tension loads in individual straps must not exceed 794 kg. (1750lb) If dual straps are used for restraining the upper torso, the total strap tension loads must not exceed 907kg (2000 lb)).</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "562" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency landing dynamic conditions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 21;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY LANDING CONDITIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10257" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2018/005/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2018-03-28T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2018-03-28T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_502859743_12
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.562(c)(2).Amendment 21;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) The maximum compressive load measured between the pelvis and the lumbar column of the anthropomorphic dummy must not exceed 680 kg. (1500lb)</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
