	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.629(d)(8).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(8) Any damage or failure condition, required or selected for investigation by CS 25.571. The single structural failures described in sub-paragraphs (d)(4) and(d)(5) of this paragraph need not be considered in showing compliance with this paragraph if;</div>" ;
