d:idSpecObject_-1112936448_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.655(b).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) If an adjustable stabiliser is used, it must have stops that will limit its range of travel to the maximum for which the aeroplane is shown to meet the trim requirements of CS 25.161. </div>" ;
