d:idSpecObject_1098922692_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.671.Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(See AMC 25.671)</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "671" ;
	o:idTitle1 "General" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 24;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "CONTROL SYSTEMS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18316" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/001/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idReqIfChapterName1 "CS 25.671.Amendment 24;" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1098922692_3
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.671(a).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) Each flight control system must operate with the ease, smoothness, and positiveness appropriate to its function. In addition, the flight control system shall be designed to continue to operate, respond appropriately to commands, and must not hinder aeroplane recovery, when the aeroplane is in any attitude or experiencing any flight dynamics parameter that could occur due to operating or environmental conditions.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "671" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "General" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 24;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "CONTROL SYSTEMS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18316" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/001/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1098922692_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.671(b).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) Each element of each flight control system must be designed to minimise the probability of incorrect assembly that could result in the failure or malfunctioning of the system. Distinctive and permanent marking may be used where design means are impractical, taking into consideration the potential consequence of incorrect assembly.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
