	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.773(b)(1)(ii).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(ii) The icing conditions specified in Appendix C and the following icing conditions specified in Appendix O, if certification for flight in icing conditions is sought (See AMC 25.773(b)(1)(ii)): </div>" ;
