d:idSpecObject_714132880_9
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.788(a)(5).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(5) the shower cubicle must be designed in a way to preclude anyone from being trapped inside. If a locking mechanism is installed, it must be capable of being unlocked from the inside and the outside without the aid of any tool.</div>" ;
