d:idSpecObject_-557746556_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.801.Amendment 15;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "801" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Ditching" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 15;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9972" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2014/026/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idReqIfChapterName1 "CS 25.801.Amendment 15;" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2014-07-23T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2014-07-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-557746556_3
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.801(a).Amendment 15;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) If certification with ditching provisions is requested, the aeroplane must meet the requirements of this paragraph and CS 25.807(i), 25.1411 and 25.1415(a).</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "801" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Ditching" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 15;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9972" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2014/026/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2014-07-23T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2014-07-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-557746556_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.801(b).Amendment 15;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) Each practicable design measure, compatible with the general characteristics of the aeroplane, must be taken to minimise the probability that in an emergency landing on water, the behaviour of the aeroplane would cause immediate injury to the occupants or would make it impossible for them to escape.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "801" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Ditching" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 15;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9972" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2014/026/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2014-07-23T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2014-07-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-557746556_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.801(c).Amendment 15;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) The probable behaviour of the aeroplane in a water landing must be investigated by model tests or by comparison with aeroplanes of similar configuration for which the ditching characteristics are known. Scoops, wing-flaps, projections, and any other factor likely to affect the hydrodynamic characteristics of the aeroplane, must be considered.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "801" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Ditching" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 15;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9972" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2014/026/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2014-07-23T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2014-07-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-557746556_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.801(d).Amendment 15;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) It must be shown that, under reasonably probable water conditions, the flotation time and trim of the aeroplane will allow the occupants to leave the aeroplane and enter the life rafts required by CS 25.1415. If compliance with this provision is shown by buoyancy and trim computations, appropriate allowances must be made for probable structural damage and leakage. If the aeroplane has fuel tanks (with fuel jettisoning provisions) that can reasonably be expected to withstand a ditching without leakage, the jettisonable volume of fuel may be considered as buoyancy volume. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "801" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(d)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Ditching" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 15;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9972" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2014/026/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2014-07-23T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2014-07-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-557746556_7
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.801(e).Amendment 15;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) Unless the effects of the collapse of external doors and windows are accounted for in the investigation of the probable behaviour of the aeroplane in a water landing (as prescribed in sub-paragraphs (c) and (d) of this paragraph), the external doors and windows must be designed to withstand the probable maximum local pressures.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
