d:idSpecObject_1187850300_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(a).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) Type. For the purpose of this CS-25, the types of exits are defined as follows:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1187850300_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(a)(1).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) Type I. This type is a floor level exit with a rectangular opening of not less than 61 cm (24 inches) wide by 121.9 cm (48 inches) high, with corner radii not greater than 20.3 cm (8 inches).</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1187850300_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(a)(2).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Type II. This type is a rectangular opening of not less than 50.8 cm (20 inches) wide by 111.8 cm (44 inches) high, with corner radii not greater than 17.8 cm (7 inches). Type II exits must be floor-level exits unless located over the wing, in which case they must not have a step-up inside the aeroplane of more than 25.4 cm (10 inches) nor a step-down outside the aeroplane of more than 43.2 cm (17 inches).</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1187850300_7
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(a)(3).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) Type III. This type is a rectangular opening of not less than 50.8 cm (20 inches) wide by 91.4 cm (36 inches) high, with corner radii not greater than 17.8 cm (7 inches), and with a step-up inside the aeroplane of not more than 50.8 cm (20 inches). If the exit is located over the wing, the step-down outside the aeroplane may not exceed 68.6 cm (27 inches).</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(3)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1187850300_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(a)(4).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(4) Type IV. This type is a rectangular opening of not less than 48.3 cm (19 inches) wide by 66.0 cm (26 inches) high, with corner radii not greater than 16.0 cm (6.3 inches), located over the wing, with a step-up inside the aeroplane of not more than 73.7 cm (29 inches) and a step-down outside the aeroplane of not more than 91.4 cm (36 inches).</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(4)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1187850300_9
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(a)(5).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(5) Ventral. This type is an exit from the passenger compartment through the pressure shell and the bottom fuselage skin. The dimensions and physical configuration of this type of exit must allow at least the same rate of egress as a Type I exit with the aeroplane in the normal ground attitude, with landing gear extended.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(5)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1187850300_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(a)(6).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(6) Tail cone. This type is an aft exit from the passenger compartment through the pressure shell and through an openable cone of the fuselage aft of the pressure shell. The means of opening the tail cone must be simple and obvious and must employ a single operation.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(6)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
