d:idSpecObject_1187850300_40
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(i).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) Ditching emergency exits for passengers. Whether or not ditching certification is requested, ditching emergency exits must be provided in accordance with the following conditions, unless the emergency exits required by subparagraph (g) of this paragraph already meet them:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(i)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1187850300_41
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(i)(1).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) For aeroplanes that have a passenger seating configuration of nine seats or less, excluding pilot seats, one exit above the waterline in each side of the aeroplane, meeting at least the dimensions of a Type IV exit.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(i)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1187850300_42
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(i)(2).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) For aeroplanes that have a passenger seating configuration of 10 seats or more, excluding pilot seats, one exit above the waterline in a side of the aeroplane, meeting at least the dimensions of a Type III exit for each unit (or part of a unit) of 35 passenger seats, but no less than two such exits in the passenger cabin, with one on each side of the aeroplane. The passenger seat/exit ratio may be increased through the use of larger exits, or other means, provided it is shown that the evacuation capability during ditching has been improved accordingly.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(i)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1187850300_43
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(i)(3).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) If it is impractical to locate side exits above the waterline, the side exits must be replaced by an equal number of readily accessible overhead hatches of not less than the dimensions of a Type III exit, except that for aeroplanes with a passenger configuration of 35 seats or less, excluding pilot seats, the two required Type III side exits need to be replaced by only one overhead hatch.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(i)(3)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1187850300_44
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.807(j).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(j) Flight crew emergency exits. For aeroplanes in which the proximity of passenger emergency exits to the flight crew area does not offer a convenient and readily accessible means of evacuation of the flight crew, and for all aeroplanes having a passenger seating capacity greater than 20, flight crew exits must be located in the flight crew area. Such exits must be of sufficient size and so located as to permit rapid evacuation by the crew. One exit must be provided on each side of the aeroplane; or, alternatively, a top hatch must be provided. Each exit must encompass an unobstructed rectangular opening of at least 48.3 cm by 50.8 cm (19 by 20 inches) unless satisfactory exit utility can be demonstrated by a typical crew member.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "807" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(j)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exits" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18458" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

