d:idSpecObject_-125199643_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(a).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) An emergency lighting system, independent of the main lighting system, must be installed. However, the sources of general cabin illumination may be common to both the emergency and the main lighting systems if the power supply to the emergency lighting system is independent of the power supply to the main lighting system. The emergency lighting system must include -</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
