d:idSpecObject_-125199643_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(b)(1)(ii).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(ii) Each passenger emergency exit sign required by CS 25.811(d)(3) must have red letters on a white background or a universal symbol, of adequate size (See AMC 25.812(b)(1)). These signs must be internally electrically illuminated or selfilluminated by other than electrical means and must have an initial brightness of at least 1.27 candela/m2 (400 microlamberts). The colours may be reversed in the case of a sign that is self-illuminated by other than electrical means.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "812" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)(1)(ii)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency lighting" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 19;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10201" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2017/015/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-125199643_11
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(b)(2).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) For aeroplanes that have a passenger seating configuration, excluding pilot seats, of 9 seats or less, each sign required by CS 25.811(d)(1), (2), and (3) must have red letters on a white background or a universal symbol, of adequate size (See AMC 25.812(b)(2)). These signs may be internally electrically illuminated, or self-illuminated by other than electrical means, with an initial brightness of at least 0.51 candela/m2 (160 microlamberts). The colours may be reversed in the case of a sign that is self-illuminated by other than electrical means.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "812" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency lighting" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 19;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10201" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2017/015/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-125199643_12
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(c).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) General illumination in the passenger cabin must be provided so that when measured along the centreline of main passenger aisle(s), and cross aisle(s) between main aisles, at seat armrest height and at 1.02 m (40-inch) intervals, the average illumination is not less than 0.5 lux (0.05 foot candle) and the illumination at each 1.02 m (40-inch) interval is not less than 0.1 lux (0.01 foot candle). A main passenger aisle(s) is considered to extend along the fuselage from the most forward passenger emergency exit or cabin occupant seat, whichever is farther forward, to the most rearward passenger emergency exit or cabin occupant seat, whichever is farther aft.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "812" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency lighting" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 19;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10201" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2017/015/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-125199643_13
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(d).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) The floor of the passageway leading to each floor-level passenger emergency exit, between the main aisles and the exit openings, must be provided with illumination that is not less than 0.2 lux (0.02 foot candle) measured along a line that is within 15 cm (6 inches) of and parallel to the floor and is centred on the passenger evacuation path. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "812" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(d)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency lighting" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 19;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10201" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2017/015/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-125199643_14
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(e).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) Floor proximity emergency escape path marking must provide emergency evacuation guidance for passengers when all sources of illumination more than 1.2 m (4 ft) above the cabin aisle floor are totally obscured. In the dark of the night, the floor proximity emergency escape path marking must enable each passenger to:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "812" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency lighting" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 19;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10201" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2017/015/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-125199643_15
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(e)(1).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) After leaving the passenger seat, visually identify the emergency escape path along the cabin aisle floor to the first exits or pair of exits forward and aft of the seat;</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "812" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency lighting" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 19;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10201" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2017/015/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-125199643_16
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(e)(2).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Readily identify each exit from the emergency escape path by reference only to markings and visual features not more than 1.2 m (4 ft) above the cabin floor. (See AMC 25.812(e)(2)); and</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "812" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency lighting" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 19;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10201" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2017/015/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-125199643_17
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(e)(3).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) In the case of passengers seated in seats authorised for occupancy during taxiing, take-off, and landing, in a compartment that does not incorporate any part of the main cabin aisle, in lieu of CS 25.812(e)(1), egress this compartment and enter the main cabin aisle using only markings and visual features not more than 1.2 m (4 ft) above the cabin floor, and proceed to the exits using the marking system necessary to complete the actions as described in CS 25.812(e)(1) and (e)(2) above.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "812" ;
