d:idSpecObject_-125199643_35
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(k).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(k) Components of the emergency lighting system, including batteries, wiring relays, lamps, and switches must be capable of normal operation after having been subjected to the inertia forces listed in CS 25.561(b).</div>" ;
