	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.813(b)(3).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) For each Type C, I or II exit installed in an aeroplane with seating for more than 80 passengers, an assist space must be provided at one side of the passageway regardless of whether an assisting means is required by CS 25.810(a).</div>" ;
