d:idSpecObject_-961563324_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.819.Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(See AMC 25.819) For aeroplanes with a service compartment located below the main deck, which may be occupied during the taxi or flight but not during take-off or landing, the following apply: </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "819" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Lower deck service compartments (including galleys)" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10037" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idReqIfChapterName1 "CS 25.819.Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-961563324_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.819(a).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) There must be at least two emergency evacuation routes, one at each end of each lower deck service compartment or two having sufficient separation within each compartment, which could be used by each occupant of the lower deck service compartment to rapidly evacuate to the main deck under normal and emergency lighting conditions. The routes must provide for the evacuation of incapacitated persons, with assistance. The use of the evacuation routes may not be dependent on any powered device. The routes must be designed to minimise the possibility of blockage, which might result from fire, mechanical or structural failure, or persons standing on top of or against the escape routes. In the event the aeroplane’s main power system or compartment main lighting system should fail, emergency illumination for each lower deck service compartment must be automatically provided.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "819" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Lower deck service compartments (including galleys)" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10037" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-961563324_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.819(b).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) There must be a means for two-way voice communication between the flight deck and each lower deck service compartment, which remains available following loss of normal electrical power generating system.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "819" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Lower deck service compartments (including galleys)" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10037" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-961563324_7
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.819(c).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) There must be an aural emergency alarm system, audible during normal and emergency conditions, to enable crew members on the flight deck and at each required floor level emergency exit to alert occupants of each lower deck service compartment of an emergency situation.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "819" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Lower deck service compartments (including galleys)" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10037" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-961563324_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.819(d).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) There must be a means, readily detectable by occupants of each lower deck service compartment that indicates when seat belts should be fastened.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "819" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(d)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Lower deck service compartments (including galleys)" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10037" ;
