d:idSpecObject_1748508159_14
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.831(f)(2).Amendment 23;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) The air inlets and passages for air to flow between flight-crew and passenger compartments are arrange to provide compartment temperatures within 2.8°C (5°F) of each other and adequate ventilation to occupants in both compartments.</div>" ;
