	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) There must be means to warn the crew when any heater whose heat output is essential for safe operation has been shut off by the automatic means prescribed in sub-paragraph (e)(1) of this paragraph.</div>" ;
