d:idSpecObject_-1699998847_11
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.863(c).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) If action by the flight crew is required to prevent or counteract a fluid fire (e.g. equipment shutdown or actuation of a fire extinguisher) quick acting means must be provided to alert the crew.</div>" ;
