d:idSpecObject_204633158_3
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.951(a).Amendment 13;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) Each fuel system must be constructed and arranged to ensure a flow of fuel at a rate and pressure established for proper engine functioning under each likely operating condition, including any manoeuvre for which certification is requested and during which the engine is permitted to be in operation.</div>" ;
