	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(7) Each fuel tank vent system must prevent explosions, for a minimum of 2 minutes and 30 seconds, caused by the propagation of flames from outside the tank through the fuel tank vents into the fuel tank vapour spaces when any fuel tank vent is continuously exposed to flames. (See AMC 25.975(a)(7)) </div>" ;
