d:idSpecObject_1273335886_3
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.981(a).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) No ignition source may be present at each point in the fuel tank or fuel tank system where catastrophic failure could occur due to ignition of fuel or vapours. This must be shown by:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "981" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Fuel tank explosion prevention" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART E – POWERPLANT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "FUEL SYSTEM" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18460" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1273335886_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.981(a)(1).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) Determining the highest temperature allowing a safe margin below the lowest expected auto-ignition temperature of the fuel in the fuel tanks.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "981" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Fuel tank explosion prevention" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART E – POWERPLANT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "FUEL SYSTEM" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18460" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1273335886_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.981(a)(2).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Demonstrating that no temperature at each place inside each fuel tank where fuel ignition is possible will exceed the temperature determined under sub-paragraph (a)(1) of this paragraph. This must be verified under all probable operating, failure, and malfunction conditions of each component whose operation, failure, or malfunction could increase the temperature inside the tank.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "981" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Fuel tank explosion prevention" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART E – POWERPLANT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "FUEL SYSTEM" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18460" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1273335886_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.981(a)(3).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) Except for the ignition sources due to lightning addressed by CS 25.954, demonstrating that an ignition source could not result from each single failure, from each single failure in combination with each latent failure condition not shown to be extremely remote, and from all combinations of failures not shown to be extremely improbable, taking into account the effects of manufacturing variability, ageing, wear, corrosion, and likely damage.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
