d:idSpecObject_-2072346087_15
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1001(f).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(f) Means must be provided to prevent jettisoning the fuel in the tanks used for take-off and landing below the level allowing climb from sea level to 3048 m (10 000 ft) and thereafter allowing 45 minutes cruise at a speed for maximum range. However, if there is an auxiliary control independent of the main jettisoning control, the system may be designed to jettison the remaining fuel by means of the auxiliary jettisoning control.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "1001" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(f)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Fuel jettisoning system" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART E – POWERPLANT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "FUEL SYSTEM COMPONENTS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8430" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-2072346087_16
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1001(g).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(g) The fuel jettisoning valve must be designed to allow flight personnel to close the valve during any part of the jettisoning operation.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "1001" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(g)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Fuel jettisoning system" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART E – POWERPLANT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "FUEL SYSTEM COMPONENTS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8430" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-2072346087_17
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1001(h).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(h) Unless it is shown that using any means (including flaps, slots and slats) for changing the airflow across or around the wings does not adversely affect fuel jettisoning, there must be a placard, adjacent to the jettisoning control, to warn flight-crew members against jettisoning fuel while the means that change the airflow are being used.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "1001" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(h)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Fuel jettisoning system" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART E – POWERPLANT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "FUEL SYSTEM COMPONENTS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8430" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-2072346087_18
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1001(i).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) The fuel jettisoning system must be designed so that any reasonably probable single malfunction in the system will not result in a hazardous condition due to unsymmetrical jettisoning of, or inability to jettison, fuel.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
