d:idSpecObject_1700492384_9
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1103(d).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) For bleed air systems no hazard may result if a duct rupture or failure occurs at any point between the engine port and the aeroplane unit served by the bleed air. (See AMC 25.1103(d).)</div>" ;
