	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1141.Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(See AMC 25.1141)Each powerplant control must be located, arranged, and designed under CS 25.777 to 25.781 and marked under CS 25.1555. In addition, it must meet the following requirements: </div>" ;
