	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) The portion of each powerplant control located in a designated fire zone that is required to be operated in the event of fire must be at least fire resistant. (See CS 25.903(c).)</div>" ;
