	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(6) An indicator for the fuel strainer or filter required by CS 25.997 to indicate the occurrence of contamination of the strainer or filter before it reaches the capacity established in accordance with CS 25.997(d).</div>" ;
