	rdfs:label "CS 25.1305(d)(1).Amendment 27;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) An indicator to indicate thrust, or a parameter that is directly related to thrust, to the pilot. The indication must be based on the direct measurement of thrust or of the parameters that are directly related to thrust. The indicator must indicate a change in thrust resulting from any engine malfunction, damage or deterioration. (See AMC 25.1305(d)(1).)</div>" ;
