	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1321(b).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) The flight instruments required by CS 25.1303 must be grouped on the instrument panel and centred as nearly as practicable about the vertical plane of the pilot’s forward vision. In addition –</div>" ;
