	rdfs:label "CS 25.1411(b).Amendment 5;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) Stowage provisions. Stowage provisions for required emergency equipment must be furnished and must – </div>" ;
