d:idSpecObject_2093360209_15
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1411(g).Amendment 5;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(g) Life line stowage provisions. If certification for ditching under CS 25.801 is requested, there must be provisions to store the lifelines. These provisions must – </div>" ;
