	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1419(d).Amendment 7;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) For turbine engine powered aeroplanes, the ice protection provisions of this paragraph are considered to be applicable primarily to the airframe. For the powerplant installation, certain additional provisions of Subpart E may be found applicable.</div>" ;
