d:idSpecObject_-285469747_12
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1420(b).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) To establish that the aeroplane can operate safely as required in sub-paragraph (a) of this paragraph, an applicant must show through analysis that the ice protection for the various components of the aeroplane is adequate, taking into account the various aeroplane operational configurations. To verify the analysis, one, or more as found necessary, of the following methods must be used:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "1420" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Supercooled large drop icing conditions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART F – EQUIPMENT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "SAFETY EQUIPMENT" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10165" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

