d:idSpecObject_-192061252_15
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1436(b)(3).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) There must be means to ensure that system pressures, including transient pressures and pressures from gas volumetric changes in components which are likely to remain closed long enough for such changes to occur –</div>" ;
