	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1459(b)(3).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) immersion in water. If the recorder is deployable, the deployed part must be designed and installed so as to minimise the probability of the recording medium being destroyed or the emergency locator transmitter failing to transmit (after damage or immersion in water) as a result of any possible combinations of:</div>" ;
