	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) Ambient temperature. An ambient temperature limitation (including limitations for winterisation installations, if applicable) must be established as the maximum ambient atmospheric temperature established in accordance with CS 25.1043(b). </div>" ;
