	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1523.Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(See AMC 25.1523)The minimum flight crew must be established (see AMC 25.1523) so that it is sufficient for safe operation, considering – The criteria used in making the determinations required by this paragraph are set forth in Appendix D. </div>" ;
