	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1587(b)(7).Amendment 21;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(7) An explanation of operational landing runway length factors included in the presentation of the landing distance, if appropriate. c) Each aeroplane flight manual (AFM) must contain the performance information associated with abnormal landing configurations (see AMC 25.1587(c)).</div>" ;
