	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) EWIS modifications to the original type design must be designed and installed to the same standards used by the original aeroplane manufacturer or other equivalent standards acceptable to the Agency.</div>" ;
