	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) Except to the extent necessary to provide electrical connection to the fuel systems components the EWIS must be designed and installed with adequate physical separation from fuel lines and other fuel system components, such that</div>" ;
