	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(k) For systems for which redundancy is required either by specific certification requirements, operating rules or by CS 25.1709, each applicable EWIS must be designed and installed with adequate physical separation. </div>" ;
