d:idSpecObject_-1425357657_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.J997(d).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) Have the capacity (with respect to operating limitations established for the APU) to ensure that APU fuel system functioning is not impaired, with the fuel contaminated to a degree (with respect to particle size and density) that is greater than that established for the APU in CS-APU 250.</div>" ;
