d:idSpecObject_1141067270_12
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part I(a)(2)(ii).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(ii) A cargo or baggage compartment defined in CS 25.857, as Class B or E must have a liner constructed of materials that meet the requirements of sub-paragraph (a)(1)(ii) of Part I of this Appendix and separated from the aeroplane structure (except for attachments). In addition, such liners must be subjected to the 45-degree angle test. The flame may not penetrate (pass through) the material during application of the flame or subsequent to its removal. The average flame time after removal of the flame source may not exceed 15 seconds, and the average glow time may not exceed 10 seconds.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part I" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(2)(ii)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Test Criteria and Procedures for Showing Compliance with CS 25.853, 25.855 or 25.869" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10034" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1141067270_13
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part I(a)(2)(iii).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(iii) A cargo or baggage compartment defined in CS 25.857 as Class B, C, E or F must have floor panels constructed of materials which meet the requirements of sub-paragraph (a)(1)(ii) of Part I of this Appendix and which are separated from the aeroplane structure (except for attachments). Such panels must be subjected to the 45-degree angle test. The flame may not penetrate (pass through) the material during application of the flame or subsequent to its removal. The average flame time after removal of the flame source may not exceed 15 seconds, and the average glow time may not exceed 10 seconds.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part I" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(2)(iii)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Test Criteria and Procedures for Showing Compliance with CS 25.853, 25.855 or 25.869" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10034" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1141067270_14
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part I(a)(2)(iv).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(iv) Insulation blankets and covers used to protect cargo must be constructed of materials that meet the requirements of sub-paragraph (a)(1)(ii) of Part I of this Appendix. Tiedown equipment (including containers, bins, and pallets) used in each cargo and baggage compartment must be constructed of materials that meet the requirements of sub-paragraph (a)(1)(v) of Part I of this Appendix.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part I" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(2)(iv)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Test Criteria and Procedures for Showing Compliance with CS 25.853, 25.855 or 25.869" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10034" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1141067270_15
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part I(a)(3).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) Electrical system components. Insulation on electrical wire or cable installed in any area of the fuselage must be selfextinguishing when subjected to the 60 degree test specified in Part I of this Appendix. The average burn length may not exceed 76 mm (3 inches), and the average flame time after removal of the flame source may not exceed 30 seconds. Drippings from the test specimen may not continue to flame for more than an average of 3 seconds after falling. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
