d:idSpecObject_-356525592_22
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part II(d)(3).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) Calorimeter</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part II" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(d)(3)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Flammability of Seat Cushions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10033" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-356525592_23
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part II(d)(3)(i).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) The calorimeter to be used in testing must be a 0–17·0 Watts/cm2 (0– 15·0 BTU per ft2 sec) calorimeter, accurate ± 3%, mounted in a 15 by 31 cm (6-inch by 12-inch) by 19 mm (0·75 inch) thick calcium silicate insulating board which is attached to a steel angle bracket for placement in the test stand during burner calibration, as shown in Figure 4.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part II" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(d)(3)(i)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Flammability of Seat Cushions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10033" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-356525592_24
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part II(d)(3)(ii).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(ii) Because crumbling of the insulating board with service can result in misalignment of the calorimeter, the calorimeter must be monitored and the mounting shimmed, as necessary, to ensure that the calorimeter face is flush with the exposed plane of the insulating board in a plane parallel to the exit of the test burner cone.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part II" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(d)(3)(ii)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Flammability of Seat Cushions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10033" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-356525592_25
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part II(d)(4).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(4) Thermocouples. The seven thermocouples to be used for testing must be 1.59 to 3.18 mm (0·0625 to 0·125 inch) metal sheathed, ceramic packed, type K, grounded thermocouples with a nominal 22 to 30 American wire gauge (AWG)-size conductor 0·643 mm (0·0253 inches) to 0·254 mm (0·010 inches) diameter. The seven thermocouples must be attached to a steel angle bracket to form a thermocouple rake for placement in the test stand during burner calibration as shown in Figure 5. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part II" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(d)(4)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Flammability of Seat Cushions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10033" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-356525592_26
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part II(d)(5).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(5) Apparatus Arrangement. The test burner must be mounted on a suitable stand to position the exit of the burner cone a distance of 102 ± 3 mm (4 ± 0·125 inches) from one side of the specimen mounting stand. The burner stand should have the capability of allowing the burner to be swung away from the specimen-mounting stand during warm-up periods. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part II" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(d)(5)" ;
