d:idSpecObject_-792266652_26
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part IV(e).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) Procedure</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part IV" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Test Method to Determine the Heat Release Rate from Cabin Materials Exposed to Radiant Heat" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10161" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-792266652_27
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part IV(e)(1).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) The power supply to the radiant panel is set to produce a radiant flux of 3·5 Watts/cm2. The flux is measured at the point, which the centre of the specimen surface will occupy when positioned for test. The radiant flux is measured after the airflow through the equipment is adjusted to the desired rate. The sample should be tested in its end use thickness.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part IV" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Test Method to Determine the Heat Release Rate from Cabin Materials Exposed to Radiant Heat" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10161" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-792266652_28
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part IV(e)(2).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) The pilot flames are lighted and their position, as described in sub-paragraph (b)(8), is checked.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part IV" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Test Method to Determine the Heat Release Rate from Cabin Materials Exposed to Radiant Heat" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10161" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-792266652_29
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part IV(e)(3).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) The airflow to the equipment is set at 0·04 ± 0·001 m3/s at atmospheric pressure. Proper air flow may be set and monitored by either: (1) An orifice meter designed to produce a pressure drop of at least 200 mm of the manometric fluid, or by (2) a rotometer (variable orifice meter) with a scale capable of being read to ± 0·0004 m3/s. The stop on the vertical specimen holder rod is adjusted so that the exposed surface of the specimen is positioned 100 mm from the entrance when injected into the environmental chamber.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part IV" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)(3)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Test Method to Determine the Heat Release Rate from Cabin Materials Exposed to Radiant Heat" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10161" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-792266652_30
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part IV(e)(4).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(4) The specimen is placed in the hold chamber with the radiation doors closed. The airtight outer door is secured, and the recording devices are started. The specimen must be retained in the hold chamber for 60 seconds ± 10 seconds, before injection. The thermopile “zero” value is determined during the last 20 seconds of the hold period. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx F Part IV" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)(4)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Test Method to Determine the Heat Release Rate from Cabin Materials Exposed to Radiant Heat" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix F" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10161" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-792266652_31
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx F Part IV(e)(5).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(5) When the specimen is to be injected, the radiation doors are opened, the specimen is injected into the environmental chamber, and the radiation doors are closed behind the specimen.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
