	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(6) Each mandatory replacement time, inspection interval, and related inspection and test procedure, and each critical design configuration control limitation for each lightning protection feature approved under CS 25.954.</div>" ;
