d:idSpecObject_1537624992_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(b).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) System fully operative. With the system fully operative, the following apply:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx K 2" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Effects of Systems on Structures" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 1;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix K – Interaction of Systems and Structure" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9423" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2005/006/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1537624992_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(b)(1).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) Limit loads must be derived in all normal operating configurations of the system from all the limit conditions specified in Subpart C, taking into account any special behaviour of such a system or associated functions or any effect on the structural performance of the aeroplane that may occur up to the limit loads. In particular, any significant nonlinearity (rate of displacement of control surface, thresholds or any other system nonlinearities) must be accounted for in a realistic or conservative way when deriving limit loads from limit conditions.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx K 2" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Effects of Systems on Structures" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 1;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix K – Interaction of Systems and Structure" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9423" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2005/006/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1537624992_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(b)(2).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) The aeroplane must meet the strength requirements of CS-25 (Static strength, residual strength), using the specified factors to derive ultimate loads from the limit loads defined above. The effect of nonlinearities must be investigated beyond limit conditions to ensure the behaviour of the system presents no anomaly compared to the behaviour below limit conditions. However, conditions beyond limit conditions need not be considered when it can be shown that the aeroplane has design features that will not allow it to exceed those limit conditions.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx K 2" ;
