d:idSpecObject_2060306491_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx N 4(a)(3)(i).Amendment 6;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) For Jet A and Jet A-1 fuel, the variation of flash point of the fuel is defined by a Gaussian curve, given by the 50 percent value and a 1-standard deviation, as shown in Table 1.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx N 4" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(3)(i)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Variables and data tables  " ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 6;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix N – Fuel Tank Flammability ExposureED Decision 2016/010/R(See )" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9596" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2009/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idParentIR1 "Appendix N – Fuel Tank Flammability Exposure" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2009-07-06T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2009-07-06T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_2060306491_9
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx N 4(a)(3)(ii).Amendment 6;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(ii) The flammability envelope of the fuel that must be used for the flammability exposure analysis is a function of the flash point of the fuel selected by the Monte Carlo for a given flight. The flammability envelope for the fuel is defined by the upper flammability limit (UFL) and lower flammability limit (LFL) as follows:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx N 4" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(3)(ii)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Variables and data tables  " ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 6;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix N – Fuel Tank Flammability ExposureED Decision 2016/010/R(See )" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9596" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2009/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idParentIR1 "Appendix N – Fuel Tank Flammability Exposure" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2009-07-06T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2009-07-06T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_2060306491_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx N 4(a)(3)(ii)(A).Amendment 6;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(A) LFL at sea level = flash point temperature of the fuel at sea level minus 5.5°C (10F). LFL decreases from sea level value with increasing altitude at a rate of 0.55 °C (1oF) per 808 feet.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx N 4" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(3)(ii)(A)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Variables and data tables  " ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 6;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix N – Fuel Tank Flammability ExposureED Decision 2016/010/R(See )" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9596" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2009/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idParentIR1 "Appendix N – Fuel Tank Flammability Exposure" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2009-07-06T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2009-07-06T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_2060306491_11
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx N 4(a)(3)(ii)(B).Amendment 6;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(B) UFL at sea level = flash point temperature of the fuel at sea level plus 19.5°C (63.5oF). UFL decreases from the sea level value with increasing altitude at a rate of 0.55°C (1oF) per 512 feet.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx N 4" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(3)(ii)(B)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Variables and data tables  " ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 6;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix N – Fuel Tank Flammability ExposureED Decision 2016/010/R(See )" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9596" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2009/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idParentIR1 "Appendix N – Fuel Tank Flammability Exposure" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2009-07-06T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2009-07-06T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_2060306491_12
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx N 4(a)(3)(4).Amendment 6;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(4) For each flight analyzed, a separate random number must be generated for each of the three parameters (ground ambient temperature, cruise ambient temperature, and fuel flash point) using the Gaussian distribution defined in Table 1. Table 1. Gaussian Distribution for Ground Ambient Temperature, Cruise Ambient Temperature, and Fuel Flash Point </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
