	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx N 4(c)(4).Amendment 6;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(4) The outside ambient air temperature (OAT) overnight temperature drop is to be chosen as a random value from the following Gaussian curve: Table 4. Outside Air Temperature (OAT) Drop </div>" ;
