	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx Q 6(a).Amendment 13;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) The steep approach landing distance determined in accordance with paragraph (SAL) 25.3 of this Appendix for the selected screen height and aeroplane configuration. The landing distance data may additionally include correction factors for runway slope and temperature other than standard, within the operational limits of the aeroplane, and may provide the required landing field length including the appropriate factors for operational variations prescribed in the relevant operating regulation. </div>" ;
