	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) Appropriate limitations and detailed normal, non-normal, and emergency procedures. Where an aeroplane is not approved for deliberate one-engine-inoperative steep approach landings, this limitation shall be stated. </div>" ;
