	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(B) the total number of passengers approved for occupancy during taxiing, take-off or landing on a deck does also not exceed one half of the maximum passenger seating capacity for that deck as indicated in the aeroplane TCDS. </div>" ;
