	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx S 1(a)(2).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) low-occupancy aeroplanes irrespective of the type of operations (commercial or non-commercial). A low-occupancy aeroplane is defined as an aeroplane which has a passenger seating configuration of:</div>" ;
