d:idSpecObject_-585877381_12
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx S 40(c)(2).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) For each seating location available for in-flight use only (including in-flight-only seats, beds, berths, and divans), a placard indicating that the location is not to be occupied during taxiing, take-off, and landing must be installed such that the placard is legible to the seated occupant.</div>" ;
