	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.121.Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.121 Climb: One-engine-inoperative ED Decision 2003/2/RM 1 In showing compliance with CS 25.121 it is accepted that bank angles of up to 2° to 3° toward the operating engine(s) may be used. 2 The height references in CS 25.121 should be interpreted as geometrical heights. </div>" ;
