d:idSpecObject_-1114859074_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.125(c)(2).Amendment 3;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.125(c)(2) Landing ED Decision 2007/010/R To ensure compliance with CS 25.125(c)(2), a series of six measured landings should be conducted on the same set of wheel brakes and tyres. [Amdt 25/3]</div>" ;
