	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.735(f).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.735(f) Brakes ED Decision 2003/2/RM For determination of the design landing brake kinetic energy capacity rating, the initial condition of the brakes may be selected and can be any condition representative of service use, including new, and which satisfies the applicable ETSO or other acceptable brake qualification test standard. </div>" ;
