d:idSpecObject_1468243898_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.785(h)(2).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.785(h)(2) Cabin Attendant Direct View ED Decision 2017/015/R If the total number of passenger seats approved for occupancy during taxiing, take-off, and landing is greater than the approved passenger seating configuration, the demonstration of compliance with the direct-view requirements should consider the most adverse combination of occupied seats, assuming the full passenger load on board. [Amdt 25/19]</div>" ;
