d:idSpecObject_-1693946779_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.810(a)(1)(iv).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.810(a)(1)(iv) Capability of assisting means in wind conditions ED Decision 2016/010/RThe applicability of the combined effect of a 46 km/hr (25-knot) wind and the engine(s) running at ground idle should be only to escape slides positioned forward of the engine(s) and in such proximity to the engine air intake(s) that the deployment of the escape slide could be influenced. [Amdt 25/18]</div>" ;
