d:idSpecObject_254013225_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.812(b)(2).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.812(b)(2) Emergency lighting ED Decision 2017/015/R For an emergency exit sign required by CS 25.811(d)(1), (2) or (3), any sign meeting the overall appearance requirements of AMC 25.812(b)(1), using English letters of at least 25 mm (1 inch) height, or a white symbolic element incorporating the ‘running man’ of at least 40 mm (1.6 inches), with an overall area of at least 64.5 cm2 (10 square inches), will be acceptable. The guidance of AMC 25.812(b)(1) regarding supplemental direction arrows is also applicable. [Amdt 25/3] [Amdt 25/19]</div>" ;
