	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.819 Lower deck service compartments (including galleys) ED Decision 2020/024/R The relevant parts of FAA Advisory Circular (AC) 25-17A Change 1, Transport Airplane Cabin Interiors Crashworthiness Handbook, dated 24.5.2016, are accepted by the Agency as providing an acceptable means of compliance with CS 25.819. Note: ‘The relevant parts’ means ‘the parts of AC 25-17A Change 1 that address the applicable FAR/CS25 paragraph’. [Amdt 25/17] [Amdt 25/26]</div>" ;
