	rdfs:label "AMC 25.1323(d).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.1323(d) Airspeed indicating system ED Decision 2003/2/RM An acceptable means of compliance when demonstrating a perceptible speed change between 1.23 VSR to stall warning speed is for the rate of change of IAS with CAS to be not less than 0.75.\" </div>" ;
