d:idSpecObject_1630865625_3
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.23(a).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) Ranges of weights and centres of gravity within which the aeroplane may be safely operated must be established. If a weight and centre of gravity combination is allowable only within certain load distribution limits (such as spanwise) that could be inadvertently exceeded, these limits and the corresponding weight and centre of gravity combinations must be established.</div>" ;
