	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) The power or equivalent thrust absorbed by the accessories and services appropriate to the particular ambient atmospheric conditions and the particular flight condition. (See AMCs No 1 and No 2 to CS 25.101(c).)</div>" ;
