	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.101(f).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(f) Unless otherwise prescribed, in determining the accelerate-stop distances, take-off flight paths, take-off distances, and landing distances, changes in the aeroplane’s configuration, speed, power, and thrust, must be made in accordance with procedures established by the applicant for operation in service.</div>" ;
