	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.101(i).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) The accelerate-stop and landing distances prescribed in CS 25.109 and 25.125, respectively, must be determined with all the aeroplane wheel brake assemblies at the fully worn limit of their allowable wear range. (See AMC 25.101(i).)</div>" ;
