d:idSpecObject_711042303_3
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.105(a).Amendment 16;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) The take-off speeds prescribed by CS 25.107, the accelerate-stop distance prescribed by CS 25.109, the take-off path prescribed by CS 25.111, the take-off distance and take-off run prescribed by CS 25.113, and the net take-off flight path prescribed by CS 25.115, must be determined in the selected configuration for take-off at each weight, altitude, and ambient temperature within the operational limits selected by the applicant -</div>" ;
