d:idSpecObject_-711665183_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.115(c).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) The prescribed reduction in climb gradient may be applied as an equivalent reduction in acceleration along that part of the take-off flight path at which the aeroplane is accelerated in level flight.</div>" ;
