	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) The one-engine-inoperative net flight path data must represent the actual climb performance diminished by a gradient of climb of 1·1% for two-engined aeroplanes, 1·4% for three-engined aeroplanes, and 1·6% for four-engined aeroplanes.</div>" ;
