d:idSpecObject_1370083084_19
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.143(d).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) The following table prescribes, for conventional wheel type controls, the maximum control forces permitted during the testing required by sub-paragraphs (a) through (c) of this paragraph. (See AMC 25.143(d)): </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "143" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(d)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "General" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "CONTROLLABILITY AND MANOEUVRABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18456" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1370083084_21
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.143(e).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) Approved operating procedures or conventional operating practices must be followed when demonstrating compliance with the control force limitations for short term application that are prescribed in sub-paragraph (d) of this paragraph. The aeroplane must be in trim, or as near to being in trim as practical, in the immediately preceding steady flight condition. For the take-off condition, the aeroplane must be trimmed according to the approved operating procedures.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "143" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(e)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "General" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "CONTROLLABILITY AND MANOEUVRABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18456" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1370083084_22
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.143(f).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(f) When demonstrating compliance with the control force limitations for long term application that are prescribed in sub-paragraph (d) of this paragraph, the aeroplane must be in trim, or as near to being in trim as practical.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "143" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(f)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "General" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "CONTROLLABILITY AND MANOEUVRABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18456" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1370083084_23
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.143(g).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(g) When manoeuvring at a constant airspeed or Mach number (up to VFC/MFC), the stick forces and the gradient of the stick force versus manoeuvring load factor must lie within satisfactory limits. The stick forces must not be so great as to make excessive demands on the pilot’s strength when manoeuvring the aeroplane (see AMC No. 1 to CS 25.143(g)), and must not be so low that the aeroplane can easily be overstressed inadvertently. Changes of gradient that occur with changes of load factor must not cause undue difficulty in maintaining control of the aeroplane, and local gradients must not be so low as to result in a danger of over-controlling. (See AMC No. 2 to CS 25.143(g)).</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "143" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(g)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "General" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "CONTROLLABILITY AND MANOEUVRABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18456" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
