d:idSpecObject_1370083084_30
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.143(i)(1).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) Controllability must be demonstrated with the most critical of the ice accretion(s) for the particular phase of flight as defined in Appendices C and O, as applicable, in accordance with CS 25.21(g).</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "143" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(i)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "General" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "CONTROLLABILITY AND MANOEUVRABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18456" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1370083084_31
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.143(i)(2).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) It must be shown that a push force is required throughout a pushover manoeuvre down to a zero g load factor, or the lowest load factor obtainable if limited by elevator power or other design characteristic of the flight control system. It must be possible to promptly recover from the manoeuvre without exceeding a pull control force of 222 N. (50 lbf); and</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "143" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(i)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "General" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 26;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "CONTROLLABILITY AND MANOEUVRABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18456" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/024/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2021-06-22T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-12-23T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1370083084_32
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.143(i)(3).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) Any changes in force that the pilot must apply to the pitch control to maintain speed with increasing sideslip angle must be steadily increasing with no force reversals, unless the change in control force is gradual and easily controllable by the pilot without using exceptional piloting skill, alertness, or strength.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
