d:idSpecObject_431726346_13
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.161(e).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) Aeroplanes with four or more engines. Each aeroplane with four or more engines must also maintain trim in rectilinear flight with the most unfavourable centre of gravity and at the climb speed, configuration, and power required by CS 25.123(a) for the purpose of establishing the en-route flight path with two engines inoperative.</div>" ;
