d:idSpecObject_925925575_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.171.Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">The aeroplane must be longitudinally, directionally and laterally stable in accordance with the provisions of CS 25.173 to 25.177. In addition, suitable stability and control feel (static stability) is required in any condition normally encountered in service, if flight tests show it is necessary for safe operation. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "171" ;
	o:idTitle1 "General" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "STABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8268" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idReqIfChapterName1 "CS 25.171.Initial issue;" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_649596876_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.173(a).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) A pull must be required to obtain and maintain speeds below the specified trim speed, and a push must be required to obtain and maintain speeds above the specified trim speed. This must be shown at any speed that can be obtained except speeds higher than the landing gear or wing flap operating limit speeds or VFC/MFC, whichever is appropriate, or lower than the minimum speed for steady unstalled flight.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "173" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Static longitudinal stability" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "STABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10151" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_649596876_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.173(b).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) The airspeed must return to within 10% of the original trim speed for the climb, approach and landing conditions specified in CS 25.175(a), (c) and (d), and must return to within 7·5% of the original trim speed for the cruising condition specified in CS 25.175(b), when the control force is slowly released from any speed within the range specified in sub-paragraph (a) of this paragraph. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "173" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Static longitudinal stability" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "STABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10151" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_649596876_7
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.173(c).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) The average gradient of the stable slope of the stick force versus speed curve may not be less than 4 N (1 pound) for each 11,2 km/h (6 kt). (See AMC 25.173(c).) </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "173" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Static longitudinal stability" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "STABILITY" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10151" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_649596876_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.173(d).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) Within the free return speed range specified in sub-paragraph (b) of this paragraph, it is permissible for the aeroplane, without control forces, to stabilise on speeds above or below the desired trim speeds if exceptional attention on the part of the pilot is not required to return to and maintain the desired trim speed and altitude.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
