d:idSpecObject_-544745901_18
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.207(h).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(h) The following stall warning margin is required for flight in icing condions before the ice protection system has been activated and is performing s intended function. Compliance must be shown using the most critical of the ice accretion(s) defined in Appendix C, part II(e), and Appendix O, part II(d), as applicable, in accordance with CS 25.21(g). The stall warning margin in straight and turning flight must be sufficient to allow the pilot to prevent stalling without encountering any adverse flight characteristics when:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "207" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(h)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Stall warning" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 18;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART B – FLIGHT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "STALLS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10132" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2016/010/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2016-06-24T00:00:00Z" ;
	cas:lists d:idSpecObject_-544745901_19 ,
		d:idSpecObject_-544745901_20 ,
		d:idSpecObject_-544745901_21 .

d:idSpecObject_-544745901_24
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.207(i).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) In showing compliance with subparagraph (h) of this paragraph, if stall warning is provided by a different means in icing conditions than for non-icing conditions, compliance with CS 25.203 must be shown using the accretion defined in appendix C, part II(e). Compliance with this requirement must be shown using the demonstration prescribed by CS 25.201, except that the deceleration rates of CS 25.201(c)(2) need not be demonstrated.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
