d:idSpecObject_-1439567751_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.253(a)(2).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Allowing for pilot reaction time after effective inherent or artificial speed warning occurs, it must be shown that the aeroplane can be recovered to a normal attitude and its speed reduced to VMO/MMO, without –</div>" ;
