	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.253(c).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) Maximum speed for stability characteristics in icing conditions. The maximum speed for stability characteristics with the most critical of the ice accretions defined in Appendices C and O, as applicable, in accordance with CS 25.21(g), at which the requirements of CS 25.143(g), 25.147(f), 25.175(b)(1), 25.177(a) through (c) and 25.181 must be met, is the lower of:</div>" ;
