d:idSpecObject_-1693011484_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.331(c)(2).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Checked manoeuvre between VA and VD. Nose up checked pitching manoeuvres must be analysed in which the positive limit load factor prescribed in CS 25.337 is achieved. As a separate condition, nose down checked pitching manoeuvres must be analysed in which a limit load factor of 0 is achieved. In defining the aeroplane loads the cockpit pitch control motions described in sub-paragraphs (i), (ii), (iii) and (iv) of this paragraph must be used: (See AMC 25.331(c)(2))</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
