	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) The aeroplane must be designed for the conditions prescribed in sub-paragraph (a) of this paragraph except that the aeroplane load factor need not exceed 1·0, taking into account, as separate conditions, the effects of –</div>" ;
