	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.445(b).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) To provide for unsymmetrical loading when outboard fins extend above and below the horizontal surface, the critical vertical surface loading (load per unit area) determined under CS 25.391 must also be applied as follows:</div>" ;
