	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.509(a)(3).Amendment 13;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) With WT as the design ramp weight, the towing load, FTOW is –</div>" ;
