	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.511(b)(4).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(4) A runway crown of zero and a runway crown having a convex upward shape that may be approximated by a slope of 1·5% with the horizontal. Runway crown effects must be considered with the nose gear unit on either slope of the crown.</div>" ;
