d:idSpecObject_875000094_3
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.519(a).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) General. The aeroplane must be designed to withstand the limit load conditions resulting from the static ground load conditions of sub-paragraph (b) of this paragraph and, if applicable, sub-paragraph (c) of this paragraph at the most critical combinations of aeroplane weight and centre of gravity. The maximum allowable load at each jack pad must be specified. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "519" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Jacking and tie-down provisions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "GROUND LOADS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8531" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_875000094_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.519(b)(1).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) For jacking by the landing gear at the maximum ramp weight of the aeroplane, the aeroplane structure must be designed for a vertical load of 1·33 times the vertical static reaction at each jacking point acting singly and in combination with a horizontal load of 0·33 times the vertical static reaction applied in any direction.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "519" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Jacking and tie-down provisions" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART C – STRUCTURE" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "GROUND LOADS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8531" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_875000094_7
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.519(b)(2)(i).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) The aeroplane structure must be designed for a vertical load of 1·33 times the vertical reaction at each jacking point acting singly and in combination with a horizontal load of 0·33 times the vertical static reaction applied in any direction.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
