	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) Castings are manufactured to accepted specifications that specify the minimum mechanical properties of the material in the casting and provides for demonstration of these properties by testing of coupons cut from the castings on a sampling basis. </div>" ;
