d:idSpecObject_-1724052015_3
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.629(a).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) General. The aeroelastic stability evaluations required under this paragraph include flutter, divergence, control reversal and any undue loss of stability and control as a result of structural deformation. The aeroelastic evaluation must include whirl modes associated with any propeller or rotating device that contributes significant dynamic forces. Compliance with this paragraph must be shown by analyses, tests, or some combination thereof as found necessary by the Agency.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "629" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Aeroelastic stability requirements" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 24;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "GENERAL" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18315" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/001/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-1724052015_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.629(b)(1).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) For normal conditions without failures, malfunctions, or adverse conditions, all combinations of altitudes and speeds encompassed by the VD/MD versus altitude envelope enlarged at all points by an increase of 15 percent in equivalent airspeed at constant Mach number and constant altitude. In addition, a proper margin of stability must exist at all speeds up to VD/MD and, there must be no large and rapid reduction in stability as VD/MD is approached. The enlarged envelope may be limited to Mach 1.0 when MD is less than 1.0 at all design altitudes; and</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "629" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Aeroelastic stability requirements" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 24;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "GENERAL" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18315" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/001/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-1724052015_7
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.629(b)(2)(i).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) The VD/MD envelope determined by CS 25.335(b); or,</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "629" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)(2)(i)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Aeroelastic stability requirements" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 24;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "GENERAL" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18315" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/001/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-1724052015_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.629(b)(2)(ii).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(ii) An altitude-airspeed envelope defined by a 15 percent increase in equivalent airspeed above VC at constant altitude, from sea level to the altitude of the intersection of 1.15 VC with the extension of the constant cruise Mach number line, MC, then a linear variation in equivalent airspeed to MC +.05 at the altitude of the lowest VC/MC intersection; then, at higher altitudes, up to the maximum flight altitude, the boundary defined by a .05 Mach increase in MC at constant altitude; and</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "629" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(b)(2)(ii)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Aeroelastic stability requirements" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 24;" ;
