d:idSpecObject_1098922692_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.671(c)(3)(ii).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(ii) The jam must be assumed to occur anywhere within the normal flight envelope and during any flight phase from take-off to landing; and In the presence of a jam considered under this sub-paragraph, any additional failure conditions that could prevent continued safe flight and landing shall have a combined probability of 1/1 000 or less.</div>" ;
