	rdfs:label "CS 25.671(d).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) The aeroplane must be designed so that, if all engines fail at any time of the flight:</div>" ;
