d:idSpecObject_-1509662283_22
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.735(h).Amendment 14;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(h) Stored energy systems. An indication to the flight crew of the usable stored energy must be provided if a stored energy system is used to show compliance with sub-paragraph (b)(1) of this paragraph. The available stored energy must be sufficient for: </div>" ;
