d:idSpecObject_1379186953_9
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.787(b).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) There must be a means to prevent the contents in the compartments from becoming a hazard by shifting, under the loads specified in sub-paragraph (a) of this paragraph. (See AMC 25.787(b))</div>" ;
