d:idSpecObject_543278036_3
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.789(a).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) Means must be provided to prevent each item of mass (that is part of the aeroplane type design) in a passenger or crew compartment or galley from becoming a hazard by shifting under the appropriate maximum load factors corresponding to the specified flight and ground load conditions, and to the emergency landing conditions of CS 25.561(b). </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "789" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Retention of items of mass in passenger and crew compartments and galleys" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Initial issue;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "PERSONNEL AND CARGO ACCOMMODATIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-8142" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2003/2/RM" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2003-10-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_543278036_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.789(b).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) Each interphone restraint system must be designed so that when subjected to the load factors specified in CS 25.561(b)(3), the interphone will remain in its stowed position. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
