d:idSpecObject_171137685_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.795(a)(1).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) Resist forcible intrusion by unauthorised persons and be capable of withstanding impacts of 300 Joules (221.3 footpounds) as well as a 1113 Newton (250 pound) tensile load on accessible handholds, including the doorknob or handle (See AMC 25.795(a)(1)); and</div>" ;
