d:idSpecObject_1047426119_4_zero
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.809(a)(0).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) (1) Each emergency exit, including a flight crew emergency exit, must be a movable door or hatch in the external walls of the fuselage, allowing unobstructed opening to the outside.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "809" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(0)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exit arrangement" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10040" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1047426119_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.809(a)(2).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Each emergency exit, including a flight crew emergency exit, must have means to permit viewing of the conditions outside the exit when the exit is closed, in all ambient lighting conditions with the landing gears extended or in any condition of collapse. The viewing means may be on or adjacent to the exit provided no obstructions exist between the exit and the viewing means. (See AMC 25.809(a))</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "809" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency exit arrangement" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 17;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10040" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2015/019/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2015-07-17T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1047426119_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.809(a)(3).Amendment 17;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) For non-over-wing passenger emergency exits, a means must also be provided to permit viewing of the likely areas of evacuee ground contact when the exit is closed with the landing gears extended or in any condition of collapse. Furthermore, the likely areas of evacuee ground contact must be viewable with the exit closed during all ambient lighting conditions when all landing gears are extended.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
