d:idSpecObject_-125199643_21
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(f)(3).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) The cockpit control device must have an ‘on’, ‘off’ and ‘armed’ position so that when armed in the cockpit or turned on at either the cockpit or cabin crew member station the lights will either light or remain lighted upon interruption (except an interruption caused by a transverse vertical separation of the fuselage during crash landing) of the aeroplane’s normal electric power. There must be a means to safeguard against inadvertent operation of the control device from the ‘armed’ or ‘on’ positions.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "812" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(f)(3)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Emergency lighting" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 19;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART D – DESIGN AND CONSTRUCTION" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "EMERGENCY PROVISIONS" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-10201" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2017/015/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2017-05-16T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_-125199643_18
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(f).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(f) Except for sub-systems provided in accordance with sub-paragraph (h) of this paragraph that serve no more than one assisting means, are independent of the aeroplane’s main emergency lighting system, and are automatically activated when the assisting means is erected, the emergency lighting system must be designed as follows:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
