	rdfs:label "CS 25.812(h)(2).Amendment 19;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) If the emergency lighting sub-system illuminating the assisting means serves no other assist means, is independent of the aeroplane’s main emergency lighting system, and is automatically activated when the assisting means is erected, the lighting provisions –</div>" ;
