d:idSpecObject_-261558925_12
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.841(b)(8).Amendment 15;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(8) The pressure sensors necessary to meet the requirements of sub-paragraphs (b)(5) and (b)(6) of this paragraph and CS 25.1447(c), must be located and the sensing system designed so that, in the event of loss of cabin pressure in any passenger or crew compartment (including upper and lower lobe galleys), the warning and automatic presentation devices, required by those provisions, will be actuated without any delay that would significantly increase the hazards resulting from decompression.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
