	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.853(c).Amendment 23;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) In addition to meeting the requirements of sub-paragraph (a) of this paragraph, seat cushions, except those on flight crewmember seats, must meet the test requirements of part II of appendix F, or other equivalent methods, regardless of the passenger capacity of the aeroplane.</div>" ;
