	rdfs:label "CS 25.855(c)(2).Amendment 13;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Cockpit voice and flight data recorder systems, windows and systems or equipment within, or in the vicinity of, Class E cargo compartments shown to be essential for continued safe flight and landing according to CS 25.1309 must be adequately protected against fire. If protective covers are used, they must meet the requirements of Appendix F, Part III</div>" ;
