	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) There is sufficient access in flight to enable a crewmember standing at any one access point and without stepping into the compartment, to extinguish a fire occurring in any part of the compartment using a hand fire extinguisher;</div>" ;
