	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) Combustion air ducts. Each combustion air duct must be fireproof for a distance great enough to prevent damage from backfiring or reverse flame propagation. In addition – </div>" ;
