	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.859(g).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(g) Heater exhaust. Heater exhaust systems must meet the provisions of CS 25.1121 and 25.1123. In addition, there must be provisions in the design of the heater exhaust system to safely expel the products of combustion to prevent the occurrence of – </div>" ;
