d:idSpecObject_349408889_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.933(a)(1).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) Each system intended for ground operation only must be designed so that either:</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "933" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(1)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Reversing systems" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 24;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART E – POWERPLANT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "GENERAL" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18318" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/001/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" ;
	cas:lists d:idSpecObject_349408889_5 .

d:idSpecObject_349408889_8
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.933(a)(2).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Each system intended for inflight use must be designed so that no unsafe condition will result during normal operation of the system, or from any failure (or reasonably likely combination of failures) of the reversing system, under any anticipated condition of operation of the aeroplane including ground operation. Failure of structural elements need not be considered if the probability of this kind of failure is extremely remote.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "933" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(a)(2)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Reversing systems" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 24;" ;
	o:idSection1 "SUBPART E – POWERPLANT" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "GENERAL" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-18318" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2020/001/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2020-01-14T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_349408889_9
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.933(a)(3).Amendment 24;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(3) Each system must have means to prevent the engine from producing more than idle thrust when the reversing system malfunctions, except that it may produce any greater forward thrust that is shown to allow directional control to be maintained, with aerodynamic means alone, under the most critical reversing condition expected in operation.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
