d:idSpecObject_1273335886_14
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.981(b)(4).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(4) Sub-Paragraph (2) does not apply to a fuel tank if following an ignition of fuel vapours within that fuel tank the aeroplane remains capable of continued safe flight and landing.</div>" ;
