	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) On aeroplanes with a diaphragm isolating the engine power section from the engine accessory section, each part of the accessory section cowling subject to flame in case of fire in the engine power section of the powerplant must –</div>" ;
