d:idSpecObject_-177099195_13
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1302(d).Amendment 3;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) To the extent practicable, installed equipment must enable the flight crew to manage errors resulting from the kinds of flight crew interactions with the equipment that can be reasonably expected in service, assuming the flight crew is acting in good faith. This sub-paragraph (d) does not apply to skill-related errors associated with manual control of the aeroplane.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
