	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(7) A warning means for the oil strainer or filter required by CS 25.1019, if it has no bypass, to warn the pilot of the occurrence of contamination of the strainer or filter screen before it reaches the capacity established in accordance with CS 25.1019(a)(2).</div>" ;
