d:idSpecObject_2076736410_7
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1307(d).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) Two systems for two-way radio communications, with controls for each accessible from each pilot station, designed and installed so that failure of one system will not preclude operation of the other system. The use of a common antenna system is acceptable if adequate reliability is shown.</div>" ;
