	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(g) Except as provided in sub-paragraph (h) of this paragraph, if the static pressure system incorporates both a primary and an alternate static pressure source, the means for selecting one or the other source must be designed so that –</div>" ;
