	rdfs:label "CS 25.1351(b)(6).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(6) There are means to indicate to appropriate crew members the generating system quantities essential for the safe operation of the system, such as the voltage and current supplied by each generator (see AMC 25.1351(b)(6)).</div>" ;
