	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(iii) A battery failure sensing and warning system with a means for disconnecting the battery from its charging source in the event of battery failure. (See AMC 25.1353(c)(6)(ii) and (iii).)</div>" ;
