	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1419(f).Amendment 7;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(f) Unless the applicant shows that the airframe ice protection system need not be operated during specific phases of flight, the requirements of paragraph (e) of this section are applicable to all phases of flight. </div>" ;
