d:idSpecObject_-285469747_19
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1420(d).Amendment 18;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) A comparative analysis may be used as an alternative to CS 25.1420(b) to establish that the aeroplane can operate safely as required in CS 25.1420(a), and as an alternative to CS 25.1420(c) regarding methods of icing detection and activation of the airframe ice protection system. In this case, tests may not be required (see AMC 25.1420(f)).</div>" ;
