d:idSpecObject_314120127_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1441(c).Amendment 23;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) Except for oxygen chemical generators and for small sealed, one-time use, gaseous oxygen bottles, there must be a means to allow the crew to readily determine, during flight, the quantity of oxygen available in each source of supply.</div>" ;
