	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1441(d).Amendment 23;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) The oxygen flow rate and the oxygen equipment for aeroplanes for which certification for operation above 12192 m (40 000 ft) is requested must be approved. (See AMC 25.1441(d).) </div>" ;
