d:idSpecObject_1943935478_18
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1701(b).Amendment 5;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) The definition in subparagraph (a) of this paragraph covers EWIS components inside shelves, panels, racks, junction boxes, distribution panels, and back-planes of equipment racks, including, but not limited to, circuit board back-planes, wire integration units and external wiring of equipment.</div>" ;
