d:idSpecObject_1220423236_28
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1707(l).Amendment 5;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(l) Each EWIS must be designed and installed so there is adequate physical separation between it and other aeroplane components and structure, and so that the EWIS is protected from sharp edges and corners, in order to minimise potential for abrasion/chafing, vibration damage, and other types of mechanical damage. </div>" ;
