	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.1711(b).Amendment 5;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) For systems for which redundancy is required either by specific certification requirements, operating rules or by CS 25.1709, concerned EWIS components must be particularly identified with its component part number, function, and separation requirement for bundles;</div>" ;
