d:idSpecObject_2092360120_6
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.J939(d).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(d) It must be established over the range of operating conditions for which certification is required, that the APU installation vibratory conditions do not exceed the critical frequencies and amplitudes established under CS-APU 120. </div>" ;
