d:idSpecObject_-1029996114_5
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.J1163(c).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(c) For essential APUs: If continued rotation of a failed aeroplane accessory driven by the APU affects the safe operation of the aeroplane, there must be means to prevent rotation without interfering with the continued operation of the APU. </div>" ;
