	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) Unless the extinguishing agent capacity and rate of discharge are based on maximum air flow through a zone, there must be means to allow the crew to shut off sources of forced ventilation to any fire zone.</div>" ;
