d:idSpecObject_945042841_4
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx I 7(b).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(b) Engine Failure Warning. If the inherent flight characteristics of the aeroplane do not provide adequate warning that an engine has failed, a warning system which is independent of the ATTCS system must be provided to give the pilot a clear warning of engine failure during take-off. </div>" ;
