d:idSpecObject_1537624992_9_zero
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(c)(1)(0).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(1) At the time of occurrence. Starting from 1-g level flight conditions, a realistic scenario, including pilot corrective actions, must be established to determine the loads occurring at the time of failure and immediately after failure.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx K 2" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(1)(0)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Effects of Systems on Structures" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 1;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix K – Interaction of Systems and Structure" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9423" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2005/006/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1537624992_10
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(c)(1)(i).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(i) For static strength substantiation, these loads multiplied by an appropriate factor of safety that is related to the probability of occurrence of the failure are ultimate loads to be considered for design. The factor of safety (F.S.) is defined in Figure 1. <object data=\"images/CS-25_27_image129.png\" type=\"image/png\"></object> Figure 1 Factor of safety at the time of occurrence</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx K 2" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(1)(i)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Effects of Systems on Structures" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 1;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix K – Interaction of Systems and Structure" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9423" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2005/006/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1537624992_14
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(c)(1)(ii).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(ii) For residual strength substantiation, the aeroplane must be able to withstand two thirds of the ultimate loads defined in subparagraph (c)(1)(i). For pressurised cabins, these loads must be combined with the normal operating differential pressure. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx K 2" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(1)(ii)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Effects of Systems on Structures" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 1;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix K – Interaction of Systems and Structure" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9423" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2005/006/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1537624992_15
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(c)(1)(iii).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(iii) Freedom from aeroelastic instability must be shown up to the speeds defined in CS 25.629(b)(2). For failure conditions that result in speed increases beyond VC/MC, freedom from aeroelastic instability must be shown to increased speeds, so that the margins intended by CS 25.629(b)(2) are maintained.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx K 2" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(1)(iii)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Effects of Systems on Structures" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 1;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix K – Interaction of Systems and Structure" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9423" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2005/006/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1537624992_16
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(c)(1)(iv).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(iv) Failures of the system that result in forced structural vibrations (oscillatory failures) must not produce loads that could result in detrimental deformation of primary structure.</div>" ;
