d:idSpecObject_1537624992_24
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(c)(2)(ii).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(ii) For static strength substantiation, each part of the structure must be able to withstand the loads in subparagraph (2)(i) of this paragraph multiplied by a factor of safety depending on the probability of being in this failure state. The factor of safety is defined in Figure 2. <object data=\"images/CS-25_27_image130.png\" type=\"image/png\"></object> Figure 2 Factor of safety for continuation of flight Qj = (Tj)(Pj) where: Tj = Average time spent in failure condition j (in hours) Pj = Probability of occurrence of failure mode j (per hour) Note: If Pj is greater than 10-3, per flight hour then a 1.5 factor of safety must be applied to all limit load conditions specified in Subpart C.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx K 2" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(2)(ii)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Effects of Systems on Structures" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 1;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix K – Interaction of Systems and Structure" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9423" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2005/006/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1537624992_31
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(c)(2)(iii).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(iii) For residual strength substantiation, the aeroplane must be able to withstand two thirds of the ultimate loads defined in subparagraph (c)(2)(ii). For pressurised cabins, these loads must be combined with the normal operating differential pressure. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
	o:idRef1 "Apdx K 2" ;
	o:idSubref1 "(c)(2)(iii)" ;
	o:idTitle1 "Effects of Systems on Structures" ;
	o:idAmendedBy1 "Amendment 1;" ;
	o:idSection1 "APPENDICES TO CS-25" ;
	o:idSubsection1 "Appendix K – Interaction of Systems and Structure" ;
	o:ideRules1 "ERULES-1963177438-9423" ;
	SpecIF:Domain "Initial airworthiness;" ;
	o:idRegulatorySource1 "ED Decision 2005/006/R" ;
	o:idRegulatorySubject1 "CS-25;" ;
	o:idTypeOfContent1 "CS (Certification specification);" ;
	o:idApplicabilityDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" ;
	o:idEntryIntoForceDate1 "2005-12-12T00:00:00Z" .

d:idSpecObject_1537624992_32
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx K 2(c)(2)(iv).Amendment 1;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(iv) If the loads induced by the failure condition have a significant effect on fatigue or damage tolerance then their effects must be taken into account.</div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
	o:idType1 "Requirement" ;
	o:idLabel1 "CS 25" ;
