d:idSpecObject_-278040378_11
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "CS 25.Apdx N 3(c)(2).Amendment 6;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(2) Fuel Tank quantities. If fuel quantity affects fuel tank flammability, inputs to the Monte Carlo analysis must be provided that represent the actual fuel quantity within the fuel tank or compartment of the fuel tank throughout each of the flights being evaluated. Input values for this data must be obtained from ground and flight test data or the EASA approved fuel management procedures. </div>" ;
	dcterms:modified "2026-02-24T16:47:22.4536074+01:00"^^xs:dateTime ;
