	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(5) Approach ice is the ice accretion on the unprotected surfaces, and any ice accretion on the protected surfaces appropriate to normal ice protection system operation, resulting from the more critical of the:</div>" ;
