	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(a) It must be demonstrated that it is possible to complete a stabilised approach in calm air down to the commencement of the landing flare, followed by a touchdown and landing without displaying any hazardous characteristics for the following conditions (see AMC to Appendix Q, (SAL) 25.5):</div>" ;
