	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">(e) Distance between Emergency Exits: deactivation of emergency exits which results in non-compliance with CS 25.807(f)(4) is acceptable on non-commercially operated aeroplanes only, provided that:</div>" ;
