d:idSpecObject_2114531899_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.121(a)(1).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.121(a)(1) Climb: One-engine-inoperative ED Decision 2003/2/RM A ‘power operating condition’ more critical than that existing at the time when retraction of the landing gear is begun would occur, for example, if water injection were discontinued prior to reaching the point at which the landing gear is fully retracted. </div>" ;
