d:idSpecObject_-679118014_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.123.Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.123 En-route flight paths ED Decision 2003/2/RM If, in showing compliance with CS 25.123, any credit is to be taken for the progressive use of fuel by the operating engines, the fuel flow rate should be assumed to be 80% of the engine specification flow rate at maximum continuous power, unless a more appropriate figure has been substantiated by flight tests. </div>" ;
