d:idSpecObject_-148020066_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.145(b)(1),.Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.145(b)(1), (b)(2) and (b)(3) Longitudinal control ED Decision 2003/2/RM The presence of gated positions on the flap control does not affect the requirement to demonstrate full flap extensions and retractions without changing the trim control.</div>" ;
