d:idSpecObject_1960716842_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.147(a).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.147(a) Directional control; general ED Decision 2003/2/RM The intention of the requirement is that the aircraft can be yawed as prescribed without the need for application of bank angle. Small variations of bank angle that are inevitable in a realistic flight test demonstration are acceptable.</div>" ;
