	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC No. 1 to 25.301(b) Loads ED Decision 2005/006/R The engine and its mounting structure are to be stressed to the loading cases for the aeroplane as a whole. [Amdt 25/1]</div>" ;
