d:idSpecObject_-1588602261_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.679(b).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.679(b) Control system gust locks ED Decision 2003/2/RM For the purposes of meeting the design intent of this paragraph, flight means the time from the moment the aircraft first moves under its own power for the purpose of flight until the moment it comes to rest after landing.</div>" ;
