	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.801 Ditching EASA accepts the relevant parts of Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) AC 25-17A ‘Transport Airplane Cabin Interiors Crashworthiness Handbook’, of 24 May 2016, as an acceptable means of compliance with CS 25.801(d). Note: ‘relevant parts’ means the AC 25-17A parts that address the applicable Federal Aviation Regulation (FAR)/CS-25 paragraph(s). [Amdt No: 25/27]</div>" ;
