d:idSpecObject_-160149969_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.810(a)(1)(v).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.810(a)(1)(v) Deployment and inflation tests ED Decision 2020/024/R For each exit, at least one of the (minimum) five consecutive deployment and inflation tests should be performed with an assisting means installed on the aeroplane. [Amdt 25/26]</div>" ;
