	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.811(d).Amendment 26;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.811(d) Sign Combination ED Decision 2020/024/R The signs required by CS 25.811(d)(1), (d)(2) and (d)(3) may be combined according to the applicable parts of FAA Advisory Circular (AC) 25-17A Change 1, Transport Airplane Cabin Interiors Crashworthiness Handbook, dated 24.5.2016. [Amdt 25/19] [Amdt 25/26]</div>" ;
