d:idSpecObject_-1921766163_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.831(c).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.831(c) Ventilation ED Decision 2003/2/RM 1 To avoid contamination the fresh air supply should be suitably ducted where it passes through any compartment inaccessible in flight. 2 Where the air supply is supplemented by a recirculating system, it should be possible to stop the recirculating system and – a. Still maintain the fresh air supply prescribed, and b. Still achieve 1. </div>" ;
