	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.901(b)(2) Assembly of Components ED Decision 2003/2/RM The objectives of CS 25.671(b) should be satisfied with respect to powerplant systems, where the safety of the aeroplane could otherwise be jeopardised. </div>" ;
