	rdfs:label "AMC 25.901(b)(4).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.901(b)(4) Electrical Bonding ED Decision 2003/2/RM Where the engine is not in direct electrical contact with its mounting, the engine should be electrically connected to the main earth system by at least two removable primary conductors, one on each side of the engine. </div>" ;
