	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.903(d)(1).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.903(d)(1) Torching Flames ED Decision 2003/2/RM Where design precautions to minimise the hazard in the event of a combustion chamber burnthrough involve the use of torching flame resistant components and/or materials, satisfaction of the standards prescribed in British Standards Institution Specification 3G100: Part 2: Section 3: Sub-section 3.13, dated December 1973, is acceptable. </div>" ;
