	rdfs:label "AMC 25.1027.Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.1027 Inadvertent Propeller Feathering ED Decision 2003/002/RM The design of the propeller feathering system should be such that it is possible to complete the feathering and the unfeathering operation under all normal operating conditions. </div>" ;
