	rdfs:label "AMC 25.1027(b).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.1027(b) Propeller Feathering ED Decision 2003/002/RM The amount of trapped oil should be sufficient to cover one feathering operation; taking into account the maximum oil leakage in the feathering system due to wear and deterioration in service. </div>" ;
