d:idSpecObject_1962807330_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.1103(d).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.1103(d) Air intake system ducts ED Decision 2003/2/RM For a single failure case leading to a fire and air duct rupture, consideration should be given to the possibility of fire aggravation due to air flowing into a designated fire zone of an engine from the remaining engine(s), or another source outside the affected fire zone. </div>" ;
