d:idSpecObject_-152681824_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.1121(a).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.1121(a) General ED Decision 2003/2/RM 1 If necessary, each exhaust system should be provided with drains to prevent hazardous accumulation of fuel under all conditions of operation. 2 Tests should be made to demonstrate compliance with CS 25.1121(a) and these should include engine starting in downwind conditions and thrust reversal. </div>" ;
