	rdfs:label ".Apdx 5.Amendment 11;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Appendix 5 – Definitions ED Decision 2011/004/R Definitions are written to support the content of this AMC and its associated certification specification. Elsewhere, terms such as “warning” may be used in a manner that is not consistent with the definitions below. However, the intent of this section is to facilitate standardisation of these terms. [Amdt 25/11]</div>" ;
