d:idSpecObject_492936656_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.1351(b)(6).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.1351(b)(6) Generating System ED Decision 2003/2/RM Each source of electrical supply (e.g. generators and batteries) should be provided with means to give the flight crew immediate warning of the failure of its output. These warning means are additional to the system indication requirements of CS 25.1351(b)(6). For multiphase systems the warning should also indicate the loss of any phase. </div>" ;
