	rdfs:label "AMC 25.1436(c)(2).Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.1436(c)(2) Pneumatic Systems ED Decision 2003/2/RM The loads due to vibration and the loads due to temperature effects are those loads, which act upon the elements of the system due to environmental conditions. </div>" ;
