d:idSpecObject_563330848_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.1523.Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.1523 Minimum flight crew ED Decision 2003/2/RM 1 Both the number and identity of the flight crew members should be established. 2 If the minimum flight crew varies with the kinds of operation to which the aeroplane is limited, the approved number and identity of the flight crew members should be stated for each kind of operation. 3 If a particular flight crew member's station has to be occupied at all material times, this should be stated when specifying the minimum flight crew. </div>" ;
