d:idSpecObject_-1825941502_root
	a o:idSpecObject1 ;
	rdfs:label "AMC 25.1545.Initial issue;" ;
	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.1545 Airspeed limitation information ED Decision 2003/2/RM A placard could be used when the speed limitation can be a simple presentation (e.g. an IAS speed up to a given altitude and an indicated Mach number thereafter). A complex speed limitation should be presented automatically on the instrument, (e.g. by means of an additional moving pointer).</div>" ;
