	rdfs:comment "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">AMC 25.1557(a) Baggage and Cargo Compartment and Ballast Location ED Decision 2003/2/RM If baggage, cargo compartment and ballast location limitations are complex and involve, for example, additional limitations on loading intensity and distribution, it is acceptable to provide a placard making reference to the appropriate document. </div>" ;
